688 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 402 0 R
/E (We also improved step-by-step mode by adding clearer progress indicators and resume visibility, allowing users to quickly re-enter a climb without confusion. )
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
689 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 402 0 R
